      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The shift to an automated economy is fundamentally a result of relentless technological progress, which is an undeniable force of nature. However, how society *responds* to this evolution is entirely dictated by policy choices. Governments and corporations must actively shape the transition through regulation, education, and social safety nets to ensure the benefits of AI are distributed equitably, rather than letting the market dictate an unequal outcome.",
      "source": "target",
